# Chorus
Take me out to the ball game, take me out with the crowd.
D4(2) D5 B4 A4 F#4 A4(3) E4(3) D4(2) D5 B4 A4 F#4 A4(3) ~A4(3)
Buy me some pea-nuts and crack-er-jack, I don't care if I nev-er get back. Let me
B4 A#4 B4 F#4 G4 A4 B4(2) G4 E4(3) B4(2) B4 B4 C#5 D5 E5 C#5 B4 A4 F#4 E4
root, root, root for the home team, if they don't win it's a shame. For it's
D4(2) D5 B4 A4 F#4 A4(3) E4(2) E4 D4(2) E4 F#4 G4 A4 B4(3) ~B4 B4 C#5
one, two, three strikes you're out at the old ball game.
D5(3) D5(3) D5 C#5 B4 A4 G#4 A4 B4(3) C#5(3) D5(3) r(3)

